.TH WAVE-LATEST 1 "" "MacWave" "MacWave Manual"

.SH NAME
wave-latest \- Compare what you have with the newest version in the index; nothing is downloaded.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B wave latest <package> | wave latest \-\-all
.SH DESCRIPTION
Compare what you have with the newest version in the index; nothing is
downloaded.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-a, \-\-all
Check every installed package
.TP
.B \-\-max\-time <string>
Maximum total time for one request (40s, 1min)
.TP
.B \-\-connect\-timeout <string>
Maximum time for the handshake
.TP
.B \-\-content\-time <string>
Maximum time to receive data
.TP
.B \-v, \-\-verbose
Print each request as it is made

.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
wave latest jq
wave latest --all
wave latest -a --max-time=1min
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
wave(1)
